{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13559","headline":"山中奉寄钱起员外兼简苗发员外 · 秦系","name":"山中奉寄钱起员外兼简苗发员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空山岁计是胡麻，穷海无梁泛一槎。\n稚子唯能觅梨栗，逸妻相共老烟霞。\n高吟丽句惊巢鹤，闲闭春风看落花。\n借问省中何水部，今人几个属诗家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}